nce\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        70+ languages supported\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        Audio tags for fine-grained control\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/Card&gt;\n\n  &lt;Card title=\&quot;Eleven Multilingual v2\&quot; href=\&quot;/docs/overview/models#multilingual-v2\&quot;&gt;\n    Lifelike, consistent quality speech synthesis model\n\n    &lt;div&gt;\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        Natural-sounding output\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        29 languages supported\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        10,000 character limit\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        Most stable on long-form generations\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/Card&gt;\n\n  &lt;Card title=\&quot;Eleven Flash v2.5\&quot; href=\&quot;/docs/overview/models#flash-v25\&quot;&gt;\n    Our fast, affordable speech synthesis model\n\n    &lt;div&gt;\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        Ultra-low latency (~100ms†)\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        32 languages supported\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        40,000 character limit\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        Faster model, 50% lower price per character for API generations\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/Card&gt;\n&lt;/CardGroup&gt;\n\n### Speech to Text\n\n&lt;CardGroup cols={2} rows={2}&gt;\n  &lt;Card title=\&quot;Scribe v2\&quot; href=\&quot;/docs/overview/models#scribe-v2\&quot;&gt;\n    State-of-the-art speech recognition model\n\n    &lt;div&gt;\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        Accurate transcription in 90+ languages\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        Keyterm prompting, up to 1000 terms\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        Entity detection, 65 entity types\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        Transcript editing with natural-language instructions\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;div&gt;\n        Precise word-level timestamps\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n\n      &lt;di