ucide-chevron-right fern-accordion-trigger-arrow"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><h6 class="fern-accordion-trigger-title">Character voiceovers</h6></summary><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:r12R5j5l:" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:r12R1j5l:" data-orientation="vertical" data-fern-style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="px-5 pt-3 pb-3"><p>Generally, more than 100 simultaneous character voiceovers can be supported for a concurrency limit of 5.</p><p>The number can vary depending on the character’s dialogue frequency, the length of pauses, and in-game actions between lines.</p></div></div></details><!--/$--><!--$--><details data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="fern-accordion-item" id="live-dubbing"><summary type="button" aria-controls="radix-:r12R5r5l:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:r12R1r5l:" class="fern-accordion-trigger" data-radix-collection-item=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right fern-accordion-trigger-arrow"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><h6 class="fern-accordion-trigger-title">Live Dubbing</h6></summary><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:r12R5r5l:" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:r12R1r5l:" data-orientation="vertical" data-fern-style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="px-5 pt-3 pb-3"><p>Concurrent dubbing streams generally follow the provided heuristic.</p><p>If the broadcast involves periods of conversational pauses (e.g. because of a soundtrack, visual scenes, etc), more simultaneous dubbing streams than the suggestion may be possible.</p></div></div></details><!--/$--></div><!--/$-->
